      en: ["Opened in 2014.", "Exhibition space: 10,000 m².", "Contains over 10,000 artifacts.", "Ain Ghazal statues are 9,000 years old.", "Dead Sea Scrolls dated to 200-100 BCE.", "Library holds 5,000 volumes."],
